Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Formulate the result using exact computed values and the approved question interpretation. Explain exclusions, uncertainty, and unanswerable components; attach the executable work order and lineage so another analyst can reproduce or revise the analysis.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
